<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef higher on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round, and loin cuts higher, while rib cuts firm but lightly tested. Beeftrimmings generally steady on light demand and offerings.-USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>157 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>  6 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>41 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     101.77	101.26	 97.49	 97.54</p>
<p>Change	    2.37	  1.81	  1.26	  1.81</p>
<p>Rib	  152.00	149.93	142.47	142.56</p>
<p>Chuck	 73.90	 72.59	 74.13	 72.66</p>
